
# Test Cases – Login & Registration

**Application:** Sample Web Application  
**Testing Type:** Manual Testing  
**Test Environment:** Demo Application  
**Status:** Not Executed

## Login Test Cases

| Test Case ID | Test Scenario | Test Description | Expected Result | Actual Result | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| TC-001 | Valid Login | Enter valid email and password. | User should log in successfully. | Not Executed | Not Executed |
| TC-002 | Invalid Password | Enter a valid email with an incorrect password. | An appropriate error message should appear. | Not Executed | Not Executed |
| TC-003 | Invalid Email | Enter an unregistered email and a password. | Login should be rejected with an appropriate message. | Not Executed | Not Executed |
| TC-004 | Empty Fields | Click Login without entering credentials. | Required-field validation should appear. | Not Executed | Not Executed |
| TC-005 | Empty Password | Enter an email but leave the password empty. | Password validation should appear. | Not Executed | Not Executed |
| TC-006 | Password Visibility | Click the password visibility icon. | Password should toggle between hidden and visible. | Not Executed | Not Executed |
| TC-007 | Forgot Password | Click the Forgot Password link. | User should be directed to password recovery. | Not Executed | Not Executed |

